  - m_Id: 31123411232088064
    m_Localized: "Welcome to FOODMISSION! \nA citizen science platform to improve
      your sustainable and nutritional behaviours. \nLet's set up your account in
      a few simple steps."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31123536339787776
    m_Localized: Choose a username that will identify you in the FOODMISSION platform.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124113580875776
    m_Localized: Enter your email address. We will use it to secure your account
      and send only important updates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124276500226048
    m_Localized: Create a secure password with at least 6 characters to protect your
      account.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124326903177216
    m_Localized: Tell us your year of birth. This helps us adapt research activities
      and recommendations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124438433914880
    m_Localized: Select your country of residence and region to connect with local
      initiatives and geographical statistics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124560802734080
    m_Localized: Please review and accept our Terms and Conditions to proceed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124623998312448
    m_Localized: Please review and accept our Privacy Policy to understand how we
      protect your data.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124709910241280
    m_Localized: Please review and accept the Informed Consent Form to participate
      in the FOODMISSION pilot study.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124844652257280
    m_Localized: I accept the Privacy Policy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31125157933211648
    m_Localized: I consent to participate in the pilot study
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31125240456142848
    m_Localized: Read Terms & Conditions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31125292482289664
    m_Localized: Read Privacy Policy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31125361180794880
    m_Localized: Read Pilot Study Consent Form
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
