  - m_Id: 33550412991684608
    m_Localized: Welcome to FOODMISSION!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33625641466191872
    m_Localized: 'There''s no pilot running in your country

      You can explore
      and use the platform, but your data won''t be used for the pilot research.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34032508952633344
    m_Localized: Choose the option that best describes your sustainable and healthy
      eating habits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34027969428054016
    m_Localized: Understanding your daily routines enables us to give you advice
      that fits in with your real-life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34022749457342464
    m_Localized: "Hello! To personalise your experience on Foodmission and help you
      achieve your goals, we\u2019d like to get to know you a bit better. Are you
      up for it?\n\nPlease answer a few optional questions so that we can personalise
      your tips, recipe suggestions and daily challenges."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34022967284326400
    m_Localized: What motivates you most about joining Foodmission? Tell us what
      your main goal is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34023051975712768
    m_Localized: A few details about you help us tailor the app to people in your
      circle and age group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34023332885028864
    m_Localized: Do you follow any special dietary requirements? This will help us
      to recommend suitable recipes and products.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
