  - m_Id: 34305618675228672
    m_Localized: "Oops! This section isn\u2019t available yet, but don\u2019t worry:
      we\u2019re working on it so you\u2019ll be able to enjoy it very soon.\n\nFOODMISSION
      is constantly evolving. We\u2019re improving the app and adding new features
      thanks to feedback from people like you. Thank you for helping us to keep growing!"
